.TH ag-remote-comment-draft-save 1  "save 0.3.0-beta.7"
.SH NAME
ag\-remote\-comment\-draft\-save \- Save private notes; does not post a comment or advance the inspected head
.SH SYNOPSIS
\fBag remote comment\-draft save\fR [\fB\-C\fR|\fB\-\-repo\fR] [\fB\-\-remote\fR] [\fB\-\-as\fR] [\fB\-m\fR|\fB\-\-message\fR] [\fB\-\-body\-file\fR] [\fB\-\-json\fR] [\fB\-\-color\fR] [\fB\-q\fR|\fB\-\-quiet\fR] [\fB\-v\fR|\fB\-\-verbose\fR] [\fB\-h\fR|\fB\-\-help\fR] [\fB\-V\fR|\fB\-\-version\fR] <\fB\-\-head\fR> <\fB\-\-expected\-version\fR> <\fIID\fR>
.SH DESCRIPTION
Save private notes; does not post a comment or advance the inspected head
.SH OPTIONS
.TP
\fB\-C\fR, \fB\-\-repo\fR \fI<DIR>\fR
Operate on the repository at this path (default: discovered from the current directory)
.TP
\fB\-\-head\fR \fI<HEAD>\fR
Exact proposal head you inspected
.TP
\fB\-\-remote\fR \fI<REMOTE>\fR
Remote to use (default: origin)
.TP
\fB\-\-as\fR \fI<IDENTITY>\fR
Act as this identity (`user:alice`, `agent:bot#run_…`, `service:ci`). Also: AG_IDENTITY
.TP
\fB\-m\fR, \fB\-\-message\fR \fI<MESSAGE>\fR [default: ]
Private comment notes
.TP
\fB\-\-body\-file\fR \fI<PATH>\fR
Read UTF\-8 notes from this file, preserving line breaks (at most 16 KiB)
.TP
\fB\-\-json\fR
Machine\-readable JSON output
.TP
\fB\-\-color\fR \fI<WHEN>\fR
Colour the output: auto (a terminal, unless NO_COLOR is set), always or never
.TP
\fB\-\-expected\-version\fR \fI<EXPECTED_VERSION>\fR
Version returned by get; use zero only after observing no draft
.TP
\fB\-q\fR, \fB\-\-quiet\fR
Print only what was asked for: no confirmations or hints. Errors and refusals are still shown
.TP
\fB\-v\fR, \fB\-\-verbose\fR
Explain what is happening on standard error: repository, identity, remote, timing
.TP
\fB\-h\fR, \fB\-\-help\fR
Print help
.TP
\fB\-V\fR, \fB\-\-version\fR
Print version
.TP
<\fIID\fR>
Proposal id or unique prefix
.SH VERSION
v0.3.0\-beta.7
